    "updated_at": "2021-03-08T15:00:48Z",
    "body": "I figured out why it failed but in order to solve it, we'll need to release a new patch? :thinking: \r\n\r\n`process_control` crate depends on `libc` which is locked to `v0.2.82`: https://github.com/starship/starship/blob/v0.50.0/Cargo.lock#L560-L564\r\nUnfortunately `libc` versions under `v0.2.87` cause compilation error on Android so we need to bump it to ensure successful compilation.\r\n\r\nI guess the proper way forward would be running:\r\n```\r\ncargo update -p libc\r\n```\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>see generated diff</summary>\r\n\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/Cargo.lock b/Cargo.lock\r\nindex f86b929..90ab724 100644\r\n--- a/Cargo.lock\r\n+++ b/Cargo.lock\r\n@@ -741,9 +741,9 @@ checksum = \"830d08ce1d1d941e6b30645f1a0eb5643013d835ce3779a5fc208261dbe10f55\"\r\n \r\n [[package]]\r\n name = \"libc\"\r\n-version = \"0.2.84\"\r\n+version = \"0.2.88\"\r\n source = \"registry+https://github.com/rust-lang/crates.io-index\"\r\n-checksum = \"1cca32fa0182e8c0989459524dc356b8f2b5c10f1b9eb521b7d182c03cf8c5ff\"\r\n+checksum = \"03b07a082330a35e43f63177cc01689da34fbffa0105e1246cf0311472cac73a\"\r\n \r\n [[package]]\r\n name = \"libgit2-sys\"\r\n\r\n```\r\n</details>\r\n\r\ncreating PR with those changes and releasing a new version?\r\n\r\n/cc @matchai ",
