    "body": "> Personally I'd prefer a regular `cargo update`. Currently `Cargo.lock` references two yanked dependencies.\r\n\r\nOk, that makes it a part of a bigger dependencies story not really suitable for a quick patch release. To enable Termux to move forward without waiting for the next Starship release I proposed patching lockfile on their end:  https://github.com/termux/termux-packages/pull/6432#issuecomment-792962733\r\nFeel free to help with your comments and ideas.",
