    "body": "@davidkna Here is the thing, #2434 fixed `libc` issue but at the same time, it introduced another one. This time culprit is `open` crate `v1.5.1`: https://github.com/termux/termux-packages/pull/6432#issuecomment-795075381\r\nIt was revealed by pure luck as Termux builds didn't use `cargo`'s `--locked` flag thus always ending up using the latest crate versions. Their build workflow got fixed so it now respects `Cargo.lock` but the issue with `open` crate remains and will pop-up as part of the upcoming Starship release.\r\n**And that is the exact reason why doing `cargo update` (all) is risky business and should be avoided especially for bugfix/patch releases!** :warning: ",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
